---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import config from '../config';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" canonicalPath="/about">
  <main>
    <h1>Hi and welcome to my Blog!</h1>
    <p>
      I am a Solutions Architect based in Dublin, Ireland, with over 10 years of professional experience as a software developer and architect. I specialise in Microsoft Azure and the wider Microsoft stack.
    </p>
    <p>
      Day to day I help customers architect and build cloud native applications on Azure, and migrate or modernise existing workloads. I am Azure Solutions Architect and DevOps Engineer certified, and I spend a fair amount of time on application platform, IaC, identity and developer experience topics.
    </p>
    <p>
      Outside of client work I like building small side projects to scratch an itch or try a new technology. A few of them end up here as posts. You can find the source for most of them on
      <a class="external" href={`https://github.com/${config.userGitHub}`} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a>.
    </p>
    <p>
      I am also a contributor to the local tech community through the
      <a class="external" href="https://www.cloudlunchlearn.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Cloud Lunch and Learn</a>
      initiative, and have spoken at community events on Azure reference architectures, including event-driven and event sourcing.
    </p>
    <p>
      Away from a keyboard I have volunteered with
      <a class="external" href="https://www.bancoalimentar.pt/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Banco Alimentar Contra a Fome</a>
      since 2012, helping sort and prepare food donations.
    </p>

    <h2>Find me online</h2>
    <ul class="links">
      <li>
        GitHub:
        <a class="external" href={`https://github.com/${config.userGitHub}`} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@{config.userGitHub}</a>
      </li>
      <li>
        LinkedIn:
        <a class="external" href={`https://www.linkedin.com/in/${config.userLinkedIn}`} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">/in/{config.userLinkedIn}</a>
      </li>
      <li>
        Twitter / X:
        <a class="external" href={`https://twitter.com/${config.userTwitter}`} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@{config.userTwitter}</a>
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Certifications</h2>
    <p>
      The current list lives on my Credly profile:
      <a class="external" href="https://www.credly.com/users/joao-goncalves.02406dd6" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">credly.com/users/joao-goncalves</a>.
    </p>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .external {
    color: cornflowerblue;
  }

  .links {
    list-style: none;
    padding-left: 0;
  }

  .links li {
    margin: 0.25rem 0;
  }
</style>
